Table full name: MITELMAN.PROD.KARYCLONE
Column name: CloneLength Type: NUMBER Description: length of clone description string -- usually between 8 and 24 characters, but can be up to 2199 characters
Column name: CaseNo Type: TEXT Description: case number, usually between 1 and 10, but can also be an arbitrary string, eg 'A11'
Column name: ChromoMin Type: NUMBER Description: most common values are between '42' and '51', but minimum value is '0' and maximum is '409'
Column name: CloneLong Type: TEXT Description: usually blank, but if the clone description is very long, that string will be stored here
Column name: CloneShort Type: TEXT Description: shorter, sometimes truncated clone description, eg '45,X,-Y' or '46,Xy,t(8;21)(q22;q22)'
Column name: InvNo Type: NUMBER Description: investigation number, between 1 and 9
Column name: RefNo Type: NUMBER Description: reference number, eg '14620'
Column name: CloneNo Type: NUMBER Description: clone number, between 1 and 58
Column name: ChromoMax Type: NUMBER Description: most common values are between '43' and '52', but minimum value is '0' and maximum is '409'
Column name: Sole Type: TEXT Description: T/F flag indicating whether or not this is the sole abnormality
Sample rows:
[{'RefNo': 4018, 'CaseNo': '33', 'InvNo': 1, 'CloneNo': 6, 'ChromoMin': 45, 'ChromoMax': 45, 'CloneShort': '45,X,-X', 'CloneLong': None, 'CloneLength': 7, 'Sole': 'T'}, {'RefNo': 11389, 'CaseNo': '8', 'InvNo': 1, 'CloneNo': 5, 'ChromoMin': 45, 'ChromoMax': 45, 'CloneShort': '45,X,-X', 'CloneLong': None, 'CloneLength': 7, 'Sole': 'T'}, {'RefNo': 5150, 'CaseNo': '18', 'InvNo': 1, 'CloneNo': 5, 'ChromoMin': 45, 'ChromoMax': 45, 'CloneShort': '45,X,-Y', 'CloneLong': None, 'CloneLength': 7, 'Sole': 'T'}, {'RefNo': 5898, 'CaseNo': '1', 'InvNo': 1, 'CloneNo': 13, 'ChromoMin': 45, 'ChromoMax': 45, 'CloneShort': '45,X,-Y', 'CloneLong': None, 'CloneLength': 7, 'Sole': 'T'}, {'RefNo': 6027, 'CaseNo': '1', 'InvNo': 1, 'CloneNo': 7, 'ChromoMin': 45, 'ChromoMax': 45, 'CloneShort': '45,X,-Y', 'CloneLong': None, 'CloneLength': 7, 'Sole': 'T'}]

